    character: {fileID: 1002337183066220262, guid: c94d393f25c7b6546860b1e3de630b9d, type: 3}
    text: That is why humans have always been calling out for someone.
    textThai: "\u0E19\u0E31\u0E49\u0E19\u0E08\u0E36\u0E07\u0E40\u0E1B\u0E47\u0E19\u0E40\u0E2B\u0E15\u0E38\u0E1C\u0E25
